        <detaileddescription>
<para>Min interval between ADC reads, ms. Per instance, not per node. Not clamped: 0 means read every loop iteration, which is legal but makes τ track the loop rate — not a controlled quantity. An <ref refid="classADS1115" kindref="compound">ADS1115</ref> <ref refid="classPinRef" kindref="compound">PinRef</ref> blocks ~8 ms per conversion whatever this says, so keep those at the default or higher. </para>
