    <briefdescription>
<para>Tuning for an <ref refid="classOpenSkyhawk_1_1AnalogInput" kindref="compound">AnalogInput</ref>. Every field has a default, so a sketch sets only what differs, by name: <computeroutput>{ .hysteresis = 32, .ewmaShift = 4, .pollMs = 2 }</computeroutput> (#295). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Fields are only ever appended, each with a default, so a new setting never breaks a sketch. The constants are the defaults and limits the fields refer to. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
